                                                "sense_id": "974059d7-dc05-3fa3-9922-37050e1f515d",
                                                "text": "Ses I, \"My sweety, see how I'll fetch you down in less than no time.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acb9d7fe-a0ac-4c79-8be2-198ea2e56109",
                                                "sense_id": "974059d7-dc05-3fa3-9922-37050e1f515d",
                                                "text": "\"Yes, dear,\" he tells her. \"You're right, dear. Of course, honey. I'll take care of everything, sweety.\""
                                            },
