                                                "example_id": "ffeff857-4f08-4b51-bd14-ac7eb149106c",
                                                "sense_id": "974059d7-dc05-3fa3-9922-37050e1f515d",
                                                "text": "'He's my sweety pie, my darling man, my honey pot. ..."
